info.Description:
The Certificate of Registration in the Field of Food Safety is a mandatory permit for economic operators carrying out the following activities:
	1.	Activities in the field of food safety of non-animal origin;
	2.	Activities related to the commercialization of food products of animal and non-animal origin, including distance selling;
	3.	Public catering services and rural tourism activities;
	4.	Activities in the field of organic agriculture;
	5.	Activities of small producers in the food sector.

The Certificate of Registration in the Field of Food Safety is also issued to individuals who conduct independent activities involving the sale of food products.
Holding the Certificate of Registration in the Field of Food Safety guarantees consumers that food products comply with food safety requirements.

